    citation: 'UnitedHealthcare\'s 2026 outpatient radiology protocol applies to certain CT, MRI, MRA, PET, and nuclear-cardiology services in outpatient or office settings, with listed plan exclusions. It does not apply in emergency, urgent-care, observation, or inpatient settings; MA does not require prior authorization for CT, MRI, or MRA. UHC may request the member\'s clinical condition, symptoms, prior treatment, and prior imaging. Informational. <https://www.uhcprovider.com/content/dam/provider/docs/public/prior-auth/radiology/COMM-Exchange-Radiology-Prior-Auth-FAQ.pdf>',
