    citation: 'Anthem processes an expedited prior-authorization review when a standard timeframe could seriously jeopardize the member\'s life, health, or ability to regain maximum function. A request that asks for expedited handling should state that clinical urgency. <https://www.anthem.com/provider/individual-commercial/prior-authorization>',
