    citation: 'Anthem behavioral-health prior authorization reviews the requested level of care against published level-of-care guidelines (e.g. MCG behavioral-health care guidelines, ASAM criteria); the request should document the criteria that support the level requested. <https://www.anthem.com/provider/policies/clinical-guidelines/>',
