    citation: 'When a prior authorization is resubmitted as a reconsideration or appeal, Anthem asks the provider to reference the original determination and supply additional clinical information that addresses the denial reason. Informational. <https://www.anthem.com/provider/individual-commercial/prior-authorization>',
