    citation: 'Humana specialty and oncology drug coverage is governed by drug-specific Medical Coverage Policies (oncology administered with Evolent / New Century Health) that condition coverage on a supporting diagnosis (ICD-10) matching the policy\'s indication; the request should carry that diagnosis. <https://provider.humana.com/coverage-claims/prior-authorizations>',
