    citation: 'Florida Blue delegates genetic / molecular testing prior authorization to its lab-management program, which requires the specific test name (and, where applicable, the unique test identifier) plus the clinical indication. <https://www.floridablue.com/providers/medical-pharmacy-info/prior-authorization>',
