    citation: 'Florida Blue directs solid-organ and hematopoietic stem-cell transplants through the Blue Distinction Centers for Transplant network; a transplant prior authorization should reference that routing and carry the transplant-center evaluation. <https://www.floridablue.com/providers/medical-pharmacy-info/prior-authorization>',
