    citation: 'Florida Blue excludes services its Medical Policy classifies as experimental, investigational, or unproven; a request for such a service must carry the peer-reviewed evidence or the documented exception the policy allows, or it will be denied. <https://www.floridablue.com/providers/medical-pharmacy-info/prior-authorization>',
