    citation: 'CareFirst BlueCross BlueShield processes an expedited prior-authorization review when a standard timeframe could seriously jeopardize the member\'s life, health, or ability to regain maximum function. A request that asks for expedited handling should state that clinical urgency. <https://provider.carefirst.com/providers/medical/in-network-precertification-preauthorization.page>',
