    citation: 'Blue Cross and Blue Shield of Kansas City processes an expedited prior-authorization review when a standard timeframe could seriously jeopardize the member\'s life, health, or ability to regain maximum function. A request that asks for expedited handling should state that clinical urgency. <https://providers.bluekc.com/login>',
