    citation: 'HMSA (Blue Cross Blue Shield of Hawaii) directs providers to submit prior-authorization requests through the HHIN (Hawaii Health Information Network) provider portal, by 278 EDI transaction, or by phone using the number on the member ID card. Informational: a cover sheet that names the channel speeds routing. <https://prc.hmsa.com/s/article/Provider-Manual-for-Prior-Authorization>',
