    citation: 'HMSA (Blue Cross Blue Shield of Hawaii) processes an expedited prior-authorization review when a standard timeframe could seriously jeopardize the member\'s life, health, or ability to regain maximum function. A request that asks for expedited handling should state that clinical urgency. <https://prc.hmsa.com/s/article/Provider-Manual-for-Prior-Authorization>',
