    id: 'R-PA-HMSA-012',
    description: 'HMSA (Blue Cross Blue Shield of Hawaii) genetic / molecular testing: the specific test and indication are documented for HMSA (Blue Cross Blue Shield of Hawaii)\'s genetic / molecular lab-management program',
