    citation: 'Indiana Medicaid directs providers to submit prior-authorization requests through the IHCP provider portal, by 278 EDI transaction, or by phone using the number on the member ID card. Informational: a cover sheet that names the channel speeds routing. <https://www.in.gov/medicaid/providers/>',
