    citation: 'Indiana Medicaid\'s site-of-care medical policy directs certain outpatient surgical and imaging services to an ambulatory surgical center or freestanding facility unless hospital-outpatient care is medically necessary; a hospital-outpatient request should document why that site is required. <https://www.in.gov/medicaid/providers/>',
